OL,3,GNEWSAThe community tea dance making a
OL,4,Adifference in Upminster
OL,5,
OL,6,FEach Thursday afternoon, the rhythmic
OL,7,Fsound of tapping feet and ballroom
OL,8,Fmusic drifts out of the New Windmill
OL,9,FHall and across Upminster Park in east
OL,10,FLondon.
OL,12,FInside, around two dozen couples in
OL,13,Ftheir 70s, 80s and 90s whirl around the
OL,14,Fhall at the weekly Havering Tea Dance.
OL,16,FIt is run by Rita Sinclair, a woman
OL,17,Fcredited with bringing the elderly
OL,18,Fcommunity of this part of Havering
OL,19,Ftogether in dance - and who has just
OL,20,Fbeen nominated for a BBC Local Radio
OL,21,FMake a Difference Award.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
